# Duet firmware files that a separately published build replaces.
#
# One line per file:
#
#   <file> sha256:<checksum of the published build> <https location>
#
# The file has to be one the reprapfirmware package delivers below
# /opt/dsf/sd/firmware, because that is the name RepRapFirmware derives from
# the board type when it flashes; a build under any other name is never used.
# Only a published build is taken, checked against the pin: no local path, no
# fallback, a mismatch stops the build. See "Replacing a Duet firmware file"
# in the README, in particular why the build needs a version string of its
# own before any board is flashed with it.
#
# Example:
#   Duet3Firmware_TOOL1LC.bin sha256:0123...cdef https://github.com/Meltingplot/RepRapFirmware/releases/download/v3.7.0-rc.1+mp1/Duet3Firmware_TOOL1LC.bin
Duet3Firmware_TOOL1LC.bin sha256:c836cdc0ce9b2fa5975128b9221ebf860030190a9bc26c120d6e7a873fd599b7 https://github.com/Meltingplot/Duet3Expansion/releases/download/3.7.0-rc.2%2B1-mp.1/Duet3Firmware_TOOL1LC.bin
Duet3Firmware_EXP1HCL.bin sha256:85ff094c61b3195296fd9549deba7f84f475cc1eba84e00adfd79fe7105e23cb https://github.com/Meltingplot/Duet3Expansion/releases/download/3.7.0-rc.2%2B1-mp.1/Duet3Firmware_EXP1HCL.bin
Duet3Firmware_SZP.bin sha256:0bc3bd5e5a3623e3e2e92fface721339f37911fa03f82de4ae7b9408d1743759 https://github.com/Meltingplot/Duet3Expansion/releases/download/3.7.0-rc.2%2B1-mp.1/Duet3Firmware_SZP.bin
# Mainboard: RepRapFirmware 3.7-dev at upstream 3.7.0-rc.2+1 (72032c51b), built
# by us against the Meltingplot library forks with a version string of its
# own, so DuetControlServer flashes it on an image update. The firmware
# reports its accelerometers under sensors.accelerometers, where
# DuetSoftwareFramework 3.7.0-rc.2 looks for them; 3.7.0-rc.1 does not.
# Upstream 3.7.0-rc.2+1 moved the MB6HC's IAP load address past the end of
# the SAME70's RAM, which would make every later update over the SBC fail;
# mp.3 puts it back at 0x20458000, where the packaged Duet3_SBCiap32_MB6HC.bin
# is linked.
Duet3Firmware_MB6HC.bin sha256:e5edec56e113fcf8887528c6789d2cb5e0840bb3bba5239b1c2642e3d9744dc9 https://github.com/Meltingplot/RepRapFirmware/releases/download/3.7.0-rc.2%2B1-mp.3/Duet3Firmware_MB6HC.bin
